---
import { ArrowUpRight } from "@phosphor-icons/react";
import { withBase } from "../../lib/urls";

const avatarSrc = withBase("/images/avatar-nightrunner91.png");
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="mt-16 scroll-mt-24 lg:mt-20"
  aria-labelledby="about-title"
>
  <div class="border-[3px] border-border bg-surface">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.35fr)_minmax(0,0.65fr)]">
      <div class="flex flex-col p-6 lg:p-8 xl:p-10">
        <h2
          id="about-title"
          class="font-mono text-3xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-text sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
        >
          Что такое
          <span class="whitespace-nowrap"
            ><span class="-ml-2 mr-0.5 inline-block bg-accent px-2 text-accent-ink"
              >Prepra</span
            >?</span
          >
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-5 max-w-[54ch] text-lg font-bold leading-relaxed text-text sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl lg:leading-snug"
        >
          Открытая база знаний по фронтенду для тех, кто готовится к
          собеседованиям самостоятельно.
        </p>

        <ul
          class="mt-5 grid max-w-[62ch] gap-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-secondary"
        >
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span
              class="mt-2 size-2 shrink-0 bg-text-tertiary"
              aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Курсов, расписания и дедлайнов нет.
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span
              class="mt-2 size-2 shrink-0 bg-text-tertiary"
              aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Темп и порядок тем выбираешь сам.
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span
              class="mt-2 size-2 shrink-0 bg-text-tertiary"
              aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Трекинг прогресса прямо в браузере.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p
          class="mt-5 max-w-[62ch] text-base leading-relaxed text-text-secondary"
        >
          Контент и код сайта открыты на
          <a
            href="https://github.com/nightrunner91/prepra"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-bold text-accent-strong underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-text"
          >
            GitHub</a
          >: можно предложить правку, добавить задачу или сообщить об ошибке.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 pt-6">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/nightrunner91/prepra/blob/main/LICENSE"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="eyebrow inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-text underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-accent-strong focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-text"
          >
            AGPL-3.0
            <ArrowUpRight size={14} weight="bold" aria-hidden="true" />
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex flex-col border-t-[3px] border-border lg:border-l-[3px] lg:border-t-0"
      >
        <a
          href="https://t.me/nightrunner91"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="group flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-6 border-b-[3px] border-border bg-surface-alt px-5 py-6 text-text transition-colors hover:bg-canvas focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-text xl:px-6 xl:py-7"
        >
          <img
            src={avatarSrc}
            alt=""
            width="64"
            height="64"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="size-16 shrink-0 border-2 border-border object-cover"
          />

          <span class="flex items-end justify-between gap-3">
            <span class="min-w-0">
              <span class="eyebrow block text-text-secondary">Автор</span>
              <span
                class="mt-1 block truncate font-mono text-xl font-extrabold text-text"
              >
                Никита Семикин
              </span>
            </span>
            <ArrowUpRight
              size={18}
              weight="bold"
              aria-hidden="true"
              className="mb-0.5 shrink-0 text-text-secondary transition-all duration-150 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-text motion-reduce:transition-none"
            />
          </span>
        </a>

        <dl class="divide-y-2 divide-border">
          <div class="px-5 py-6 xl:px-6 xl:py-7">
            <dt class="eyebrow text-text-tertiary">Основной стек</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-text">
              JavaScript / React / Vue
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="px-5 py-6 xl:px-6 xl:py-7">
            <dt class="eyebrow text-text-tertiary">В работе</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-text">
              Node.js, PostgreSQL, банк задач
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="px-5 py-6 xl:px-6 xl:py-7">
            <dt class="eyebrow text-text-tertiary">Прогресс</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-text">
              В браузере, без аккаунта
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
